SUMMARY:Milonga Clara
LOCATION:Hotel Continental - Art Space in Exile\, Elsenstraße 87\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: Milonga Clara · Tango de Tarde\n----------\nToday\, o
 n the 10th of October\, we are inviting you to a relaxed Saturday milonga 
 in a beautiful\, light-filled gallery.\n\nExpect carefully selected classi
 c tango music and a warm\, welcoming atmosphere. No performances\, no fuss
 . Just good dancing and good company.\nMilonga Clara is baby and family fr
 iendly. There will be a dedicated space for children with toys and activit
 ies\, and childcare will be available during the milonga\, so that tango p
 arents can enjoy the afternoon on the dance floor too.\n\nCoffee\, homemad
 e cake\, and a selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks will be ava
 ilable throughout the milonga.\n\nCome for tango\, stay for the atmosphere
 .\nAlicja & Onur\n----------\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/events/1642
 825123892970\n\nVeranstalter: Milonga Latidos\, Ala MaLisa und Onur Gümr
 ükçü\n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/495474/Milonga-Cl
 ara
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/495474/Milonga-Clara
