DESCRIPTION:Milonga: Back from summer break and here to save your Thursday!
 \n\nLa Luna Improvisada: A milonga for you. Good wooden floor\, traditiona
 l tango music\, home party vibe.\n\nWe have a new venue for the next dates
 \, Gemeindehaus: Bigger space\, wooden floor\, a terrace we can use to rel
 ax until 10 pm. You can easily walk there from S&U Neukölln and U Karl-Ma
 rx-Straße - so we stay in the neighborhood.\n\n- Gemeindehaus Magdalenenk
 irche\, Karl-Marx-Str. 197\n-  DJ Maria August\n- Organizers & class: Dani
 el Koile & Maria August\n- Thursday\, Oct 15\n\n- Double role class: 19:00
 \n- Milonga: 20:00 – 01:00\n\n We’ll have an open buffet – bring foo
 d\, drinks\, something to share\, and let’s make it a real community tab
 le.\n\nMixed level class where we switch roles and partners. You don't hav
 e to be fit in both roles yet.\n\n- Prices: Milonga Sliding scale (Selbste
 inschätzung) between 7-12€ | Class 10€ | Class & Milonga 15 € | USC
  accepted for either the class or the milonga\n\n- Now (at least) every 1s
 t & 3rd Thursday! Next dates: November 5th\, November 15th\n\nPS: We are l
 ooking for volunteers to help us with the set up\, take down and reception
 . You can enjoy the class and milonga for free. Just message us \n--------
 -\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/LaLunaImprovisada\n\nVeranstalter: La 
 Luna Improvisada · Tango · Berlin Maria August\n\nhttps://www.hoy-milong
 a.com/berlin/de/milonga/493966/La-Luna-Improvisada-@Gemeindehaus
