UID:499478@hoy-milonga-berlin
DTSTAMP:20261017T183000Z
DTSTART:20261017T183000Z
DTEND:20261017T223000Z
SUMMARY:La Raíz Milonga
LOCATION:Tangotanzen macht schön (TTMS)\, Oranienstraße 185\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: La Raíz Milonga\n----------\nTango class for all leve
 ls:\n- 19:15–20:30 Sheena & Emiliano\nMilonga: from \n- 20:30 Tango Trad
 itional \n- Dj Guest Pablo Montanelli from Argentina\n\nA warm and welcomi
 ng space for dancers of all levels\, hosted at Tangotanzen macht schön in
  Kreuzberg.\n\nEntry: 12 €.\nReduced entrance before 21 hs\nUrban Sport 
 plus 5 euro.\nIf you come to class\, the milonga is 5 euros.\n----------\n
 \nLa Raíz Milonga\n\nA raíz is a root. It is where we come from\, what s
 ustains us\, and what allows us to grow.\n\nInspired by the essence of Arg
 entine Tango\, La Raíz is a space for connection\, listening\, and shared
  experience. A place where the embrace comes before the figures\, where mu
 sic guides the movement\, and where every tanda becomes a conversation.\n\
 nIn a city that is constantly moving\, we invite you to return to the root
 s: the pleasure of dancing\, meeting\, and being present.\n\nJoin us for a
 n evening of tango\, encounters\, and community.\n\nBack to the roots\, fo
 rward through the embrace.\n\nTangotanzen macht schön – Berlin\nLa Raí
 z Milonga\n----------\nQuelle: https://https://www.facebook.com/rafael.tan
 go.berlin\n\nVeranstalter: Sebastian Marco \, Tangotanzen macht schön\n\n
 https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/499478/La-Raiz-Milonga
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/499478/La-Raiz-Milonga
