SUMMARY:Tango Bizarre
LOCATION:KitKatClub\, Köpenicker Str. 76 (Brückenstr.1)\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: !!! Admission for Tango 19-21:30. After that there are
  long queues and difficult to get into the club !!!\n-----------------\n!!
